      "description": "A display of seaside rock, categorised according to the phrase it bears. The phrases are:\nNUMPTY; SLAP HEAD' OLD TART; PERVERT; MINGER; OLD FART; SEX MANIAC; FOOTBALL CRAZY;\nLAZY LOUT; LAGER LOUT; LITTLE ANGEL; LITTLE DEVIL; MY GUY; MY GIRL; SUPER STAR; LITTLE STAR;\nARSENAL; ASTON VILLA; BLACKBURN ROVRS; BURNLEY; CHELSEA; EVERTON; LEEDS UNITED; LEICESTER CITY;\nLIVERPOOL; MAN CITY; MAN UTD; NEWCASTLE UTD; SPURS; WEST HAM; WEST ;BROM; WOLVES'\nJUST FOR YOU; I ♥ YOU; HOT LIPS; SOMEONE SPECIAL; PRINCESS; TO MY FRIEND; TO MY TEACHER; TO MY SWEETHEART;\nBIG BOY; UP YOURS; SUCK ON THIS; OLD SLAPPER; SEX BOMB; MY SLAVE; MY NYMPHO; SEXY BABE\nTHE BOSS; THE STUD; MY BEST MATE; COOL DUDE; GROOVY CHICK; THE MENACE; BEER MONSTER; LOVER BOY;\nTHANK YOU; CONGRATULATIONS; BEST WISHES; JUST MARRIED; STAG PARTY; HEN PARTY; BAD BOY; BAD GIRL;\nLITTLE TINKER; HORNY DEVIL; SEXY LADY; YOU PLONKER; DREAM LOVER; TOY BOY; TOP TOTTY; NUTTY TART;\nGRANDSON; GRANDAUGHTER (sic); UNCLE; AUNTIE; NEPHEW; NIECE; TO NANA; COUSIN\nJUST FOR DAD; TO MY MUM; GRANDAD; GRANDMA; SON; DAUGHTER; BROTHER; SISTER\nI think there's some interesting anthropology in the choice of slogans, and in which are most in demand.",
